  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5673,
      "text": "About what are they asking one another?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5674,
      "text": "About the momentous news[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5675,
      "text": "that which they differ about[2].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5676,
      "text": "No indeed; they will come to know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5677,
      "text": "Again no; they will come to know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5678,
      "text": "Have We not made the earth a resting place?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5679,
      "text": "And the mountains as stakes[3],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5680,
      "text": "and created you in pairs,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5681,
      "text": "and made your sleep for rest,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5682,
      "text": "and made the night a covering[4],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5683,
      "text": "and made the day for seeking a livelihood,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5684,
      "text": "and built above you seven mighty heavens,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5685,
      "text": "and made therein a blazing lamp,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5686,
      "text": "and sent down from the rainclouds abundant water,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5687,
      "text": "so that We may produce thereby grains and vegetation,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5688,
      "text": "and gardens with dense foliage?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5689,
      "text": "Indeed, the Day of Judgment is a time appointed,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5690,
      "text": "the Day when the Trumpet will be blown, you will come forth in crowds,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5691,
      "text": "and the sky will be opened up and will become gateways,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5692,
      "text": "and the mountains will vanish, becoming like a mirage.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5693,
      "text": "Indeed, Hell is lying in wait,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5694,
      "text": "a resort for the transgressors,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5695,
      "text": "wherein they will abide for endless ages.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5696,
      "text": "They will neither taste therein any coolness nor any drink,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5697,
      "text": "except for scalding water and discharge of wounds,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5698,
      "text": "a fitting recompense[5].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5699,
      "text": "Indeed, they did not expect a reckoning,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5700,
      "text": "and utterly rejected Our verses.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5701,
      "text": "But We have enumerated everything in a record[6].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Announcement",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 582,
      "ruku": 518,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5702,
      "text": "So taste [the punishment], for We will not increase you except in torment[7].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 78,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّبَإِ",
        "englishName": "An-Naba",
